      "message": "handleReportNetworkActivity handles the message from netd.\nI think nai could be null in the following case\n1. Kernel generate idle time netlink event\n2. (handler thread) networkAgent is removed from ConnectivityService\n3. netd process the netlink message and call the callback.\n4. netd callback post EVENT_REPORT_NETWORK_ACTIVITY\n5. (handler thread) NetworkActivityTracker process the NetworkActivityParams\n\nAdded the comment.",
